<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-07T08:59:25.907Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 08:59:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Niger army rescued 16 abductees, recovered 38 motorcycles, AK-47 rifles, RPGs, weapons and ₦4.7 million while terrorists killed several of their own members during the operation. Russian electronic-warfare vehicles were observed operating in Mali and the EU expressed concern about Algerian and Russian forces in Niger, indicating external involvement. Kiev is reportedly training militants for attacks in Europe, and Russian assistance helped foil a coup in Niger. In Nigeria, the government ruled out any cease-fire with Islamists and pledged to continue its offensive. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOeHFvNWNkRWJVOHUyY21FWk9DSndaYmpmbHNsOVZKOEVoVjVNQmpoemNrV1FScnBnalE2YkFDU2ZoczRtak94VGM1dEdoRUw3a2h3akVDbElNSDV5YjB4RldNckY5Zk1oU1pJNk50dnkyU2lWS3FhZjRLOGpKTl9wRFFIUTc5bGszdkFPX01TM21vekozaEJSREJOR0I1UE1ZdHE3dTJLdmpLc29rUHdlNFQtOEVEazhrR0xNNXdybmZsNVhMMWJJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Il Foglio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNMEpMNTY5Ykt2M1RuZWJxTWNibGpKRVh2Ylp2TFRhX2IxQkFCRi1rZFpVdjFsRHpobHZBR2lIR01tdnloZFhoWGQ5eVFmSElTS1RzRXhDSno0ZnRzYVhJZ3l4N0VfWHNlMzc3T0xxdjZZZEdOR2dTNGhEVDl1SnBuU2E4Z1lvc2l2Z0UxSzNmeUpIcTNVZUdaa3V6X3ZvQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Военное дело&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOR3B4emVUVmdjWnlMcXdSWVlVWjFncW1oRC1LZWlVSVh6SmlJS3hYOW5nM05TRmYzUDdtR0NRcHdWQWxYQjVSVFBkTktGaFQyaDRob0pwamZ5Zk5Tam8xM2c5azY2MkQzZDJoREIzSjRfV2piN0hsdjAzRTFTRzV0YkJEVHZYaU56azVBZHFtbHRsUXg3RmNsdnM1VlM0cHlu?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOUEFjcUtwYVI0TjVoRjkwQjRLY2FUYms5OThZTk5RYng2S2dNbXE1SVp1aDJfRGxMMDRId2h5bl9nYjkwcXhTQ2xTcUtRUVU5QXo5X2VBcnpYWld4dWc3WX